    <worksheet name='Billing based on medical condition and Gender'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1. How does the average billing amount vary by medical condition and gender?</run>
